abstract: >-
  PACE Controller is a Windows graphical interface for classic Druck PACE 5000
  and PACE 6000 pressure controllers connected through Ethernet. It provides
  telemetry, target and slew control, programmable routines, source-margin
  protection, and sample/inlet pressure-loss monitoring.
